scope: |
  Filed as friction (a doc commit under v3/specs forces a rebuild). Same one-line cause points the
  other way and there it is dangerous: `specs/` excluded wholesale hid the F FRONT from the digest,
  so smoke-ci could not see a change to the default compiler. Fixing the digest widens the claim to
  its own gate, which was green on the defect.
next: land the digest fix + the two gate cases, then release
